  "AI as tool, delegate, collaborator, or future subject": "AI konman zouti, delege, kolaborater, ouswa fitir size",
  "AI content payment is not merely a copyright or transaction-efficiency problem; it is a question of political-economic legitimacy. As AI valuations reach hundreds of billions, society asks why the gains from public web content and human knowledge accrue to a few firms. The paper proposes a six-layer tiered data market — from free public content through scarce verified datasets to public benefit-sharing — and defines the AI network democratic economy: rights, pricing, participation, auditability, and returns, each democratized through machine-readable protocols like AICR/AICL.": "Peman pour kontenyen AI pa senpleman en problenm drwa dotèr ouswa efikasite transaksyon; se en kestyon lezitimite politiko-ekonomik. Alors ki valorizasyon AI i ariv santenn milyar, sosyete i demande akoz ki bann gen ki sorti dan kontenyen web piblik ek konesans imen i al zis avek en tigit lantrepriz. Sa dokiman i propoz en marse done avek si lakous an nivo — depi kontenyen piblik gratis, atraver bann lansanb done rar ki verifye, ziska partaz benefis piblik — e i defini lekonomi rezo demokratik AI: drwa, lo pri, partisipasyon, kapasite pour verifye, ek rannman, sakenn demokratize atraver bann protokol ki masin i kapab lir tel ki AICR/AICL.",
  "AI crawler simulator: four personas (search indexer, RAG assistant, model-training pipeline, commercial redistributor) evaluated against a site’s declarations; undeclared rights surface as uncertainty, illustrating the Protocolized Openness thesis.": "Simulater crawler AI: kat persona (endekser rese, asistan RAG, pipline antrennman model, redistribiter komersyal) i ganny evalye kont bann deklarasyon en sit; bann drwa ki pa deklare i paret konman lensertitid, ki ilistre tèz Louvertir Protokolize.",
