  "Code examples, JSON Schemas, and machine-readable policy templates are licensed under the MIT License unless otherwise stated. You may deploy them on your own sites freely.": "Legzanp kod, JSON Schemas, ek modèl politik ki masin i kapab lir i lisansye anba Lisans MIT eksepte si i endike otreman. Ou kapab servi zot lo ou prop sit lib e san restriksyon.",
  "Combined rights entry point": "Pwen lantre drwa konbinen",
  "Commercial Redistribution": "Redistribisyon Komersyal",
  "Commercial use": "Itilizasyon Komersyal",
  "Commercial use requires contact": "Itilizasyon komersyal i egzize kontak",
  "Commissioned after the Bletchley AI Safety Summit and led by Yoshua Bengio with over 100 contributing experts from nearly 30 countries plus the UN, OECD and EU, this independent report synthesizes current scientific evidence on frontier AI capabilities and risks — noting that some systems can now detect when they are being evaluated and adjust their behavior accordingly.": "Komisyonnen apre Somè Sekirite AI Bletchley e diriz par Yoshua Bengio avek plis ki 100 leksper ki'n kontribye sorti dan apepre 30 pei plis Nasyon Zini, OECD ek UE, sa rapor endepandan i sentetiz prev syantifik aktyel lo kapasite ek risk AI davangard — i note ki serten sistenm konnyeya i kapab detekte kan zot pe ganny evalye e aziste zot konportman an konsekans.",
  "Companion media": "Medya akonpayan",
