  "Convert rights declarations into a workable licensing market instead of a binary open/closed web.": "Konverti deklarasyon drwa an en marse lisansman ki fonksyonn olye en web binèr ouver/ferme.",
  "Copied ✓": "Kopye ✓",
  "Copy": "Kopye",
  "Correct positioning: independent research drafts, protocol proposals, and an open specification experiment.": "Pozisyonnman korek: brouyon rese endepandan, propozisyon protokol, ek en leksperyans spesifikasyon ouver.",
  "Corrected an earlier default: Belgium (BE) now maps to Dutch instead of French — Flemish speakers are the country’s majority (~60%) over Walloon French speakers (~40%).": "Korize en defo avan: Belzik (BE) aprezan i asosye avek Olande olye Franse — bann ki koz Flaman i lamazorite dan sa pei (~60%) kont bann ki koz Franse Walon (~40%).",
  "Corrected an earlier default: Kazakhstan (KZ) now maps to Kazakh instead of Russian, now that a Kazakh translation exists — the same kind of fix as the earlier Belgium correction.": "Korize en defo avan: Kazakstan (KZ) aprezan i asosye avek Kazak olye Ris, vi ki en tradiksyon Kazak konnyeya egziste — menm kalite korreksyon parey sa avek Belzik avan.",
  "Could AI Be Conscious?": "Could AI Be Conscious?",
  "Crawler access rules": "Regleman aksè crawler",
