  "Turns declared rights into executable licensing: quote, pay, verify, audit, revoke.": "Konverti drwa deklare an lisansman egzekitab: devi, peye, verifye, verifikasyon (lodit), anile.",
  "Twenty languages live in total: English, Traditional Chinese, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Korean, French, German, Spanish, Portuguese, Russian, Arabic, Turkish, Persian, Bengali, Hindi, Indonesian, Vietnamese, Greek, Italian, Dutch.": "Vin lalang an dire antou: Angle, Sinwa Tradisyonnel, Sinwa Senplifye, Zapone, Koreyen, Franse, Alman, Espanyol, Portige, Ris, Arab, Tirk, Persan, Bengali, Endi, Endonezyen, Vyetnamyen, Grek, Italyen, Olande.",
