  "UI": "Lentèrfas Itilizater",
  "Undefined openness reads as legal uncertainty to AI pipelines and gets cleaned out; only protocolized, machine-readable permission makes content genuinely learnable.": "Louvertir ki pa'n ganny defini i ganny lir konman lensertitid legal pour bann pipline AI e i ganny neplwaye; selman permisyon protokolize, ki masin i kapab lir, i fer kontenyen vreman posib pour aprann.",
