  "Verified in both LTR and RTL contexts: the panel mirrors correctly for Arabic and Persian without any special-casing, using logical CSS positioning.": "Verifye dan toulede kontekst LTR ek RTL: panno-la i reflekte korekteman pour Arab ek Persan san okenn tretman spesyal, an servi pozisyonnman CSS lozik.",
