  "Versioned specifications, JSON Schemas, and the policy files actually deployed on this site. Every file can be downloaded, validated, and cited directly.": "Spesifikasyon avek vèrsyon, JSON Schemas, ek bann fisye politik ki vreman deplwaye lo sa sit-la. Sak fisye i kapab ganny telesarze, valide, ek site direkteman.",
